<Slide style={{ padding: 60, background: '#0F172A' }}>
  <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12, marginBottom: 22 }}>
    <Box style={{ width: 6, height: 28, background: '#6366F1', borderRadius: 3 }} />
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#F1F5F9' }}>防线五 · 审计哈希链</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 1, background: '#334155', marginBottom: 22 }} />
  <Box style={{ background: '#0B1120', border: '1px solid #334155', borderRadius: 12, padding: '18px 24px', marginBottom: 22 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#A5B4FC', fontFamily: 'Consolas, monospace', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>
      hash = HMAC(prev_hash ‖ payload)<br/>
      任何一条被改 → <Text style={{ color: '#F87171', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>断点处立即检出</Text>
    </Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12, marginBottom: 24 }}>
    {['h₀', 'h₁', 'h₂'].map((h, i) => (
      <Box key={i} style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 150, height: 64, background: '#1E293B', border: '1px solid #6366F1', borderRadius: 10, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#A5B4FC', fontFamily: 'Consolas, monospace' }}>{h}</Text>
        </Box>
        <FAIcon name='arrow-right' style={{ fill: '#6366F1', width: 22, height: 22 }} />
      </Box>
    ))}
    <Box style={{ width: 170, height: 64, background: '#450A0A', border: '1px solid #EF4444', borderRadius: 10, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#F87171' }}>篡改 → 断点</Text>
    </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ background: '#1E293B', borderLeft: '4px solid #6366F1', borderRadius: 8, padding: '18px 24px' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#CBD5E1', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
      <Text style={{ color: '#A5B4FC', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>真实故事：</Text>日志超 2000 条触发分级保留，裁剪后 id 跳号，链校验报「链接断裂」；原注释写着「允许这种情况」，<Text style={{ color: '#F87171', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>但实现里没有这个逻辑</Text>。修复：裁剪后重封链 + 启动自检，留痕 audit.reseal，不掩盖。
    </Text>
  </Box>
  <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#64748B', marginTop: 18 }}>安全驾驶舱「审计链校验：连续完整（1,400+ 条）」——我们不是在演示顺利路径，而是真的在测自己的东西。</Text>
  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', bottom: 26, left: 60 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#475569' }}>AgentBank · 智能体银行</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', bottom: 26, right: 60 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#475569' }}>10 / 18</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
